      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. i've been looking at the timing and it's just way too coincidental. like, the payroll delay happened right after i mentioned my severance package in a meeting. and the menu change? i've worked here 3 years and they've never done that before. it feels like they're following a script to make me look unstable. do you think this kind of pattern is actually a recognizable tactic in corporate environments, or am i just overthinking it?",
