      "content": "it's such a relief to hear someone else say that because i was starting to feel like i was losing my mind. it's so calculated. since you mentioned it's a coordinated effort, how should i handle the actual people involved? like, if my manager tries to act all \"concerned\" for my wellbeing because i'm acting \"stressed,\" should i treat that as part of the psychological play? i want to make sure i don't fall into their trap.",
